NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene1_1::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Gramps!\n"
	.string "I’m fed up with waiting!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene1_2::
	.string "OAK: {RIVAL}?\n"
	.string "Let me think…\p"
	.string "Oh, that’s right, I told you to\n"
	.string "come! Just wait!\p"
	.string "Here, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "There are three POKéMON here.\p"
	.string "Haha!\p"
	.string "The POKéMON are held inside\n"
	.string "these POKé BALLS.\p"
	.string "When I was young, I was a serious\n"
	.string "POKéMON TRAINER.\p"
	.string "But now, in my old age, I have\n"
	.string "only these three left.\p"
	.string "You can have one.\n"
	.string "Go on, choose!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene1_3::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Hey! Gramps! No fair!\n"
	.string "What about me?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene1_4::
	.string "OAK: Be patient, {RIVAL}.\n"
	.string "You can have one, too!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_1::
	.string "Recently, there have been sightings\n"
	.string "of many rare POKéMON species.\p"
	.string "I’m talking about POKéMON that\n"
	.string "have never been seen in KANTO.\p"
	.string "I would love to go see things for\n"
	.string "myself, but I’m much too old.\p"
	.string "Since I can’t do it, {PLAYER}, I’d\n"
	.string "like you to go in my place.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_2::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Hey, I heard that!\p"
	.string "Gramps, what’s with favoring\n"
	.string "{PLAYER} over me all the time?\p"
	.string "I went and collected more POKéMON,\n"
	.string "and faster, too.\p"
	.string "You should just let me handle\n"
	.string "everything.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_3::
	.string "OAK: I know, I know.\n"
	.string "Of course I need your help, too.\p"
	.string "Now, I need to see both your\n"
	.string "POKéDEXES.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_4::
	.string "PROF. OAK took both POKéDEX\n"
	.string "units.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_5::
	.string "… … …  … … …\p"
	.string "… … …  … … …\p"
	.string "…And that’s done!\p"
	.string "Now these units can record data on\n"
	.string "a lot more POKéMON.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_6::
	.string "{PLAYER}’s POKéDEX was upgraded!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_7::
	.string "Now, {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}!\p"
	.string "This time, you really must work\n"
	.string "towards filling your POKéDEXES.\p"
	.string "I urge you to make them the best\n"
	.string "and the most complete of all time!\p"
	.string "Truly, this is a monumentally great\n"
	.string "undertaking in POKéMON history!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_FrameScene2_8::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Gramps, calm down.\n"
	.string "Don’t get so excited.\p"
	.string "I’ll get the POKéDEX completed,\n"
	.string "don’t you worry about a thing.\p"
	.string "I think I’ll try looking around\n"
	.string "ONE ISLAND first…\p"
	.string "Anyways, I’m outta here!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "There are only two of us, so we’re\n"
	.string "always busy.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "There was a loud noise outside...\p"
	.string "When we went to look, someone\n"
	.string "stole a POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It’s unbelievable that anyone would\n"
	.string "do that!\p"
	.string "...sigh...\n"
	.string "That stolen POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I wonder how it’s doing.\n"
	.string "They say a POKéMON raised by a bad\l"
	.string "person turns bad itself.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_1::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, I’ll call you if\n"
	.string "anything comes up.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_2::
	.string "ELM: Thanks for coming from so\n"
	.string "far...\p"
	.string "Allow me to see that mysterious\n"
	.string "POKéBALL\p"
	.string "Hmmm...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "It looks as if this POKéBALL comes\n"
	.string "from a distant past...\p"
	.string "It is said that there was a POKéBALL\n"
	.string "connected to a time-travel POKéMON\l"
	.string "once, so I wonder if this is that\l"
	.string "POKéBALL.\p"
	.string "I know! Why don’t you ask KURT?\p"
	.string "KURT is the master of POKéBALL\n"
	.string "making that lives at AZALEA TOWN,\l"
	.string "and I think he would know a little\l"
	.string "more about it.\p"
	.string "Well, good luck on your journey,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_3::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "There you are!\p"
	.string "I called because I have something\n"
	.string "for you.\p"
	.string "See? It’s an S.S.TICKET.\p"
	.string "Now you can catch POKéMON in KANTO.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_4::
	.string "The ship departs from OLIVINE CITY.\p"
	.string "But you knew that already, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "After all, you’ve traveled all over\n"
	.string "with your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Give my regards to PROF.OAK in\n"
	.string "KANTO!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_5::
	.string "ELM: Hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Thanks to you, my research\l"
	.string "is going great!\p"
	.string "Take this as a token of my\n"
	.string "appreciation.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_6::
	.string "The MASTER BALL is the best!\p"
	.string "It’s the ultimate BALL! It’ll catch\n"
	.string "any POKéMON without fail.\p"
	.string "It’s given to recognized POKéMON\n"
	.string "researchers.\p"
	.string "I think you can make better use of\n"
	.string "it than I can, {PLAYER}!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_7::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, you look great!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_8::
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "That POKéMON!?!\p"
	.string "The EGG hatched!\n"
	.string "So, POKéMON are born from EGGS…\p"
	.string "No, perhaps not all POKéMON are.\p"
	.string "Wow, there’s still a lot of research\n"
	.string "to be done.\p"
	.string "Thanks, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You’re helping unravel POKéMON\l"
	.string "mysteries for us!\p"
	.string "I want you to have this as a token of\n"
	.string "our appreciation.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_9::
	.string "That’s an EVERSTONE.\p"
	.string "Some species of POKéMON evolve\n"
	.string "when they grow to certain levels.\p"
	.string "A POKéMON holding the EVERSTONE\n"
	.string "won’t evolve.\p"
	.string "Give it to a POKéMON you don’t want\n"
	.string "to evolve.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_10::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "Didn’t you meet my\l"
	.string "assistant?\p"
	.string "He should have met you with the EGG\n"
	.string "at VIOLET CITY’s POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "You must have just missed him. Try to\n"
	.string "catch him there.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_11::
	.string "ELM: Don’t give up! I’ll call if\n"
	.string "I learn anything about that EGG!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_12::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}, this is terrible...\p"
	.string "Oh, yes, what was MR.POKéMON’s big\n"
	.string "discovery?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} handed the MYSTERY EGG to\n"
	.string "PROF.ELM.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_13::
	.string "ELM: This?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_14::
	.string "But... Is it a POKéMON EGG?\p"
	.string "If it is, it is a great discovery!\p"
	.string "ELM: What?!?\p"
	.string "PROF.OAK gave you a POKéDEX?\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, is that true? Th-that’s\l"
	.string "incredible!\p"
	.string "He is superb at seeing the potential\n"
	.string "of people as trainers.\p"
	.string "Wow, {PLAYER}. You may have what it\n"
	.string "takes to become the CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "You seem to be getting on great\n"
	.string "with POKéMON too.\p"
	.string "You should take the POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "challenge.\p"
	.string "The closest GYM would be the one\n"
	.string "in VIOLET CITY.\p"
	.string "...{PLAYER}. The road to the\n"
	.string "championship will be a long one.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_15::
	.string "Before you leave, make sure that you\n"
	.string "talk to your mom.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_16::
	.string "If a wild POKéMON appears, let your\n"
	.string "POKéMON battle it!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_17::
	.string "MR.POKéMON goes everywhere and finds\n"
	.string "rarities.\p"
	.string "Too bad they’re just rare and\n"
	.string "not very useful...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, I’m counting on you!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist2_18::
	.string "ELM: Hey, has that EGG changed any?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_1::
	.string "OAK: Now, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Inside those three POKé BALLS are\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Which one will you choose for\n"
	.string "yourself?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_2::
	.string "POKéMON around the world wait for\n"
	.string "you, {PLAYER}!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_3::
	.string "Ah, now this is excellent!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, I have another important\n"
	.string "favor to ask of you.\p"
	.string "I need you to listen closely.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_4::
	.string "OAK: Oh, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "How is my old POKéMON?\p"
	.string "Well, it seems to be growing more\n"
	.string "attached to you.\p"
	.string "You must be talented as a POKéMON\n"
	.string "TRAINER.\p"
	.string "What’s that?\n"
	.string "You have something for me?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_5::
	.string "{PLAYER} delivered OAK’S PARCEL.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_6::
	.string "Ah! \n"
	.string "It’s the custom POKé BALL!\p"
	.string "I had it on order.\n"
	.string "Thank you!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_7::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Gramps!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_8::
	.string "{RIVAL}: I almost forgot!\n"
	.string "What did you call me for?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_9::
	.string "OAK: Oh, right!\n"
	.string "I have a request for you two.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_10::
	.string "On the desk there is my invention,\n"
	.string "the POKéDEX!\p"
	.string "It automatically records data on\n"
	.string "POKéMON you’ve seen or caught.\p"
	.string "It’s a high-tech encyclopedia!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_11::
	.string "OAK: {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}.\n"
	.string "Take these with you.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_12::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX\n"
	.string "from PROF. OAK.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_13::
	.string "OAK: You can’t get detailed data\n"
	.string "on POKéMON by just seeing them.\p"
	.string "You must catch them to obtain\n"
	.string "complete data.\p"
	.string "So, here are some tools for\n"
	.string "catching wild POKéMON.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_14::
	.string "{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_15::
	.string "When a wild POKéMON appears,\n"
	.string "it’s fair game.\p"
	.string "Just throw a POKé BALL at it and\n"
	.string "try to catch it!\p"
	.string "This won’t always work, however.\p"
	.string "A healthy POKéMON can escape.\n"
	.string "You have to be lucky!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_16::
	.string "To make a complete guide on all\n"
	.string "the POKéMON in the world…\p"
	.string "That was my dream!\p"
	.string "But, I’m too old.\n"
	.string "I can’t get the job done.\p"
	.string "So, I want you two to fulfill my\n"
	.string "dream for me.\p"
	.string "Get moving, you two.\p"
	.string "This is a great undertaking in\n"
	.string "POKéMON history!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_17::
	.string "{RIVAL}: All right, Gramps!\n"
	.string "Leave it all to me!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_18::
	.string "{PLAYER}, I hate to say it, but you\n"
	.string "won’t be necessary for this.\p"
	.string "I know! I’ll borrow a TOWN MAP\n"
	.string "from my sis!\p"
	.string "I’ll tell her not to lend you one,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}! Hahaha!\p"
	.string "Don’t bother coming around to\n"
	.string "my place after this!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_19::
	.string "OAK: {PLAYER}, raise your young\n"
	.string "POKéMON by making it battle.\p"
	.string "It has to battle for it to grow.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_20::
	.string "OAK: If a wild POKéMON appears,\n"
	.string "your POKéMON can battle it.\p"
	.string "With it at your side, you should be\n"
	.string "able to reach the next town.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_21::
	.string "OAK: Come see me sometime.\p"
	.string "After all, I want to know how your\n"
	.string "POKéDEX is coming along.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Scientist3_22::
	.string "Ah, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "How is your POKéDEX shaping up?\p"
	.string "{RIVAL} has already caught some\n"
	.string "POKéMON and added to the data.\p"
	.string "So, {PLAYER}, let’s have a look at\n"
	.string "your POKéDEX.\p"
	.string "…What’s the matter?\n"
	.string "You’ve added no new data at all.\p"
	.string "I’ll give you these, so do try a\n"
	.string "little harder.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_1::
	.string "Those are POKé BALLS.\n"
	.string "They contain POKéMON!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_2::
	.string "It contains a POKéMON caught by\n"
	.string "PROF.ELM.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_3::
	.string "ELM: So, you like CHIKORITA, the\n"
	.string "grass POKéMON?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_4::
	.string "ELM: Think it over carefully.\p"
	.string "Your partner is important.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_5::
	.string "ELM: Do you want TOTODILE, the\n"
	.string "water POKéMON?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_6::
	.string "ELM: You’ll take CYNDAQUIL, the\n"
	.string "fire POKéMON?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_7::
	.string "ELM: I think that’s a great POKéMON\n"
	.string "too!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_8::
	.string "{PLAYER} received CHIKORITA!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_9::
	.string "{PLAYER} received TOTODILE!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_10::
	.string "{PLAYER} received CYNDAQUIL!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_11::
	.string "Do you want to give a nickname to\n"
	.string "this CHIKORITA?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_12::
	.string "Do you want to give a nickname to\n"
	.string "this TOTODILE?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_13::
	.string "Do you want to give a nickname to\n"
	.string "this CYNDAQUIL?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_14::
	.string "MR.POKéMON lives near CHERRYGROVE,\n"
	.string "the next city.\p"
	.string "It’s almost a direct route to\n"
	.string "there.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_15::
	.string "If your POKéMON is hurt, you should\n"
	.string "heal it with this machine.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_16::
	.string "Oh, allow me to register my\n"
	.string "phone number on your PHONE CARD.\p"
	.string "Call me if something comes up.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_17::
	.string "{PLAYER} got ELM’s phone number.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_ItemBall_18::
	.string "Oh, yes! your mom also gave me your\n"
	.string "POKéBEEPER number, so I can call\l"
	.string "you if I ever need anything.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Blue_1::
	.string "{RIVAL}: What, it’s only {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "Gramps isn’t around.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Blue_2::
	.string "{RIVAL}: My POKéMON looks a lot\n"
	.string "tougher than yours.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Blue_3::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Heh, I don’t need to be\n"
	.string "greedy like you. I’m mature!\p"
	.string "Go ahead and choose, {PLAYER}!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Pokedex::
	.string "It’s like an encyclopedia, but the\n"
	.string "pages are blank.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "ELM: Wait! Where are you going?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger4::
	.string "I heard a POKéMON was stolen here...\n"
	.string "I was just getting some information\l"
	.string "from PROF.ELM.\p"
	.string "Apparently, it was a young male with\n"
	.string "long, red hair...\p"
	.string "What?\p"
	.string "You battled a trainer like that?\p"
	.string "Did you happen to get his name?\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "OK! So {RIVAL} was his name.\p"
	.string "Thanks for helping my investigation!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger7::
	.string "ELM: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "There you are!\p"
	.string "I needed to ask you a favor.\p"
	.string "I have an acquaintance called\n"
	.string "MR.POKéMON.\p"
	.string "He keeps finding weird things and\n"
	.string "raving about his discoveries.\p"
	.string "Anyway, I just got an e-mail from him\n"
	.string "saying that this time it’s real.\p"
	.string "It is intriguing, but we’re busy with\n"
	.string "our POKéMON research.\p"
	.string "Could you look into it for us?\p"
	.string "I’ll give you a POKéMON for a partner.\p"
	.string "They’re all rare POKéMON that we just\n"
	.string "found.\l"
	.string "Go on. Pick one!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger10_1::
	.string "{PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Use these on your POKéDEX quest!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger10_2::
	.string "To add to your POKéDEX, you have to\n"
	.string "catch POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Throw POKéBALLS at wild POKéMON\n"
	.string "to get them.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger10_3::
	.string "{PLAYER}, I want you to have this for\n"
	.string "your errand.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Trigger10_4::
	.string "There are only two of us, so we’re\n"
	.string "always busy.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Sign1::
	.string "It seems this machine can heal\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\l"
	.string "Want to use it?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Sign3::
	.string "Travel Tip 3:\n"
	.string "Open your PACK and press SELECT to\l"
	.string "move items.\p"
	.string "Travel Tip 4:\n"
	.string "Check your POKéMON moves. Press the\l"
	.string "“A” Button to switch moves.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Sign4_1::
	.string "Travel Tip 1:\n"
	.string "Press START to open the MENU.\p"
	.string "Travel Tip 2:\n"
	.string "Record your trip with SAVE!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior3_Text_Sign4_2::
	.string "All POKéMON types have strong and\n"
	.string "weak points against others.$"
